PROGRAM stock lookup contracts

RECORD StockItem
  sku: text
  available: integer

RECORD Inventory
  items: list<StockItem>

RECORD Reading
  sku: text
  available: integer

RECORD Query
  sku: text

RECORD Selection
  item: optional<StockItem>

RECORD Receipt
  matched: boolean

REQUEST preview stock count
  GIVEN inventory is Inventory
  AND reading is Reading
  WHEN LET selection be Selection:
  WHEN preview reading against inventory into selection
  OUTPUT selection is Selection
  AND inventory is Inventory

REQUEST record stock count
  GIVEN inventory is Inventory
  AND reading is Reading
  GIVEN receipt is Receipt
    matched: false
  WHEN record reading against inventory into receipt
  OUTPUT inventory is Inventory
  AND receipt is Receipt

REQUEST retain stock selection
  GIVEN inventory is Inventory
  AND query is Query
  AND selection is Selection
  WHEN retain selection for query from inventory
  OUTPUT selection is Selection
  AND inventory is Inventory

WHEN stock snapshot for <sku> in <inventory>
  GIVEN sku is text
  AND inventory is Inventory
  THEN returns Selection
  LET selection be Selection:
  FIND item in inventory.items WHERE item.sku == sku
    set selection.item to item
  ELSE
    PASS
  RETURN selection

WHEN preview <reading> against <inventory> into <selection>
  GIVEN reading is Reading
  AND inventory is Inventory
  AND selection is Selection
  REQUIRE reading.available >= 0
  LET snapshot be stock snapshot for reading.sku in inventory
  set selection.item to snapshot.item
  IF selection.item is present
    set selection.item.available to reading.available

WHEN record <reading> against <inventory> into <receipt>
  GIVEN reading is Reading
  AND inventory is Inventory
  AND receipt is Receipt
  REQUIRE reading.available >= 0
  FIND item in inventory.items WHERE item.sku == reading.sku
    set item.available to reading.available
    set receipt.matched to true
  ELSE
    set receipt.matched to false

WHEN retain <selection> for <query> from <inventory>
  GIVEN selection is Selection
  AND query is Query
  AND inventory is Inventory
  FIND item in inventory.items WHERE item.sku == query.sku
    set selection.item to item
  ELSE
    PASS

BACKGROUND
GIVEN first is StockItem
  sku: "widget"
  available: 5

GIVEN duplicate is StockItem
  sku: "widget"
  available: 9

GIVEN inventory is Inventory
  items: [first, duplicate]

GIVEN reading is Reading
  sku: "widget"
  available: 2

SCENARIO preview changes a snapshot without changing stock
REQUEST preview stock count
THEN selection.item is present and selection.item.available == 2
AND inventory.items == [first, duplicate]

SCENARIO a missing preview has no selected item
WHEN set reading.sku to "missing"
REQUEST preview stock count
THEN selection.item is absent
AND inventory.items == [first, duplicate]

SCENARIO recording changes only the first matching stock item
REQUEST record stock count
GIVEN expected is StockItem
  sku: "widget"
  available: 2
THEN receipt.matched == true
AND inventory.items == [expected, duplicate]

SCENARIO recording a missing SKU leaves stock unchanged
WHEN set reading.sku to "missing"
REQUEST record stock count
THEN receipt.matched == false
AND inventory.items == [first, duplicate]

SCENARIO a missing lookup retains a previous selection
GIVEN query is Query
  sku: "missing"
GIVEN selection is Selection
  item: first
REQUEST retain stock selection
THEN selection.item is present and selection.item == first
AND inventory.items == [first, duplicate]

SCENARIO a matching lookup replaces a previous selection
GIVEN query is Query
  sku: "widget"
GIVEN selection is Selection
  item: duplicate
REQUEST retain stock selection
THEN selection.item is present and selection.item == first
AND inventory.items == [first, duplicate]

SCENARIO empty stock retains an absent selection
WHEN set inventory.items to []
GIVEN query is Query
  sku: "widget"
WHEN LET selection be Selection:
REQUEST retain stock selection
THEN selection.item is absent
AND inventory.items == []
